		<description><![CDATA[In addition to my post above I wanted to add that you can see Iman in action in the movie &quot;Woodstock&quot; very briefly, wearing white as a nurse in the tent for first aid. She is gone in a blink but if you are careful you can notice her, she looks at the camera and keeps moving off into the tent, busy as ever, on a mission. But she was there, ... alive, ... in the picture, ... and this is how her life was, ... contributing, caring, doing the real work of the message.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In addition to my post above I wanted to add that you can see Iman in action in the movie &#8220;Woodstock&#8221; very briefly, wearing white as a nurse in the tent for first aid. She is gone in a blink but if you are careful you can notice her, she looks at the camera and keeps moving off into the tent, busy as ever, on a mission. But she was there, &#8230; alive, &#8230; in the picture, &#8230; and this is how her life was, &#8230; contributing, caring, doing the real work of the message.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
